528564", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217753377", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012828546", "personaname": "AntediluvianArk", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/antediluvianark/", "num_games_owned": 2368, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 95, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95, "last_played": 1770429050, "avatar": "017f59d680a53db9c0553f3adc147452ed840e92"}, "language": "english", "review": "I've long wanted a solo PVE looter shooter, but now I am not sure. \n\nFelt tedious and repetitive. Probably more of a ME problem as I have a growing distaste of the treadmill-style game loops with small incremental upgrades, crafting, and ingredient collection. Looter shooters with PVP aspects likely introduce enough chaos to mask the repetition. \n\nThe Duck theme is a one-note joke and didn't really do much for me. Sort of hurt the immersion. \n\nMost players seem to love this, so mine is a minority opinion. As Levar Burton said, \"You don't have to take my word for it.\" \n\n", "timestamp_created": 1770443886, "timestamp_updated": 1770443886, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.542351067066192627", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217750597", "author": {"steamid": "76561197976401573", "personaname": "Daltz_26", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197976401573/", "num_games_owned": 251, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4877, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4508, "last_played": 1771554693, "avatar": 